g src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/65b7/46e9/366118_normal.png?m=1730997579\" alt=\"zwyyy456\" data-uid=\"366118\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zwyyy456\">zwyyy456</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 14:12:30 +08:00\">12h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>已经升级了 macOS 27 ，m1pro ，感觉变流畅了，但是有些地方的 ui 变丑了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088270\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/532a/bddd/680065_normal.png?m=1729067018\" alt=\"akechiz\" data-uid=\"680065\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/akechiz\">akechiz</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 16:36:22 +08:00\">9h 37m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果你闲着吃饱没事干，可以升级</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088326\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f107/fcfa/638403_normal.png?m=1782802072\" alt=\"wuhan027\" data-uid=\"638403\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wuhan027\">wuhan027</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 16:43:42 +08:00\">9h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>麻烦问一下，我是同款 M1 Pro 16+512 ，macOS 系统版本是 15.7.7 。我不知道升级之后，微信的版本会自动跟着升级到最新版吗？我的微信还是 3.7.0 版本，一直在稳定使用微信小助手插件，担心微信版本自动升级后，插件失效。有人知道这个问题的答案吗？知道的话麻烦回复告知一下，感谢哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088393\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3b846f3d22c57358a50ab422ae2266ed?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"AADDD\" data-uid=\"662995\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AADDD\">AADDD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 16:53:24 +08:00\">9h 20m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>建议等等，我这升了后感觉 bug 有点多，有文字重影的，还有访达窗口往左上角跳。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18088534\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/660aa3792947b15b8417758dd4baa049?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"WDATM33\" data-uid=\"643258\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/WDATM33\">WDATM33</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 17:10:40 +08:00\">9h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>同 M1 PRO ，这 26 我用着续航是真拉跨 没招了只能看看升级 27 能不能有点提升了。最大容量还有 96%。但是不插电刷两小时抖音就没电了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18089032\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/127d/cd62/274795_normal.png?m=1759359703\" alt=\"nonevs\" data-uid=\"274795\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nonevs\">nonevs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-15 18:48:31 +08:00\">7h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n           